  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, says that David Grusch, a former US intelligence officer who became a whistleblower on UFO matters, spoke at a press event in Washington DC in the 2020s about the idea of sentient plasmoid life. Plasmoids are glowing balls of electrically charged gas, and the suggestion, as Michels tells it, is that some of them might be alive and aware, which would mean intelligence can exist in forms we hardly think of as living."
